{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/sbi903it","slide":9,"text":"• Add, update, delete, and undo expense deletion\n• Search, category, and time filters\n• Budget progress and spending summaries\n• Category, weekly, and six-month charts\n• Currency, theme, sample data, and local data actions\n• Works offline after it has loaded","textPreview":"• Add, update, delete, and undo expense deletion | • Search, category, and time filters | • Budget progress and spending summaries | • Ca...","textChars":258,"textLines":6,"bbox":[104,307,420,190]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/dcra98ze","slide":9,"bbox":[672,224,536,340]}
