{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w7ud8nmh","slide":9,"text":"Data is not automatically shared between the phone and the Chrome website. Each installation keeps its own local expense and settings storage.","textPreview":"Data is not automatically shared between the phone and the Chrome website. Each installation keeps its own local expense and settings sto...","textChars":142,"textLines":1,"bbox":[704,307,408,82]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vm1czi5c","slide":9,"text":"That is intentional for an offline app: there is no sign-in or cloud sync feature in the current version.","textPreview":"That is intentional for an offline app: there is no sign-in or cloud sync feature in the current version.","textChars":105,"textLines":1,"bbox":[704,417,408,55]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/alsv6d4r","slide":9,"bbox":[72,602,1136,48]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9kjux8n6","slide":9,"text":"Bottom line: choose mobile for a pocket tracker or Chrome for a wider workspace; the core experience stays the same.","textPreview":"Bottom line: choose mobile for a pocket tracker or Chrome for a wider workspace; the core experience stays the same.","textChars":116,"textLines":1,"bbox":[95,616,1085,20]}
